+// LIVE_AB lifecycle emitter (protocol 3.2 rule 4)
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Appends ONE line per completed slot occupancy to the file named by
+// LIVE_AB_LIFECYCLE_LOG. Disabled -- and costs nothing -- when that variable is
+// unset, so an unpatched-behaviour run is the default.
