+// WHAT A RECORD MEANS: this slot was OCCUPIED BY A DECODING REQUEST between the
+// stated timestamps. It does NOT assert uninterrupted hardware utilization:
+// scheduler pauses inside an occupancy are part of the operational regime.
+//
+// CLOCK: every timestamp is a raw ggml_time_us() reading, which on this POSIX
+// build is clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC) in MICROSECONDS (ggml/src/ggml.c).
